       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "A dam safety emergency developed at Halvern Dam on the Sorrel River at Brindlemark in the Assek Valley from September 9, 2025.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Halvern Dam and its right abutment were damaged, and the alert level was raised from Yellow to Orange.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "A mandatory evacuation moved roughly 11,800 and later 12,400 residents from Brindlemark, with further evacuations from Ferris Hollow and Quennard.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The Sorrel Basin Water Authority issued information on the dam, police deployed to Brindlemark and assistance was provided in Quennard.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
